  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Public Finance Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Climate change, ecosystem degradation and environmental pollution are increasingly threatening people&#xbf;s livelihoods. At the same time, the existing knowledge repository in the field of Green Public Financial Management (PFM) is notably in its nascent stages, as it remains in an early phase of knowledge and insight generation. Hence, the Action develops and implements Green PFM measures in these settings to enhance partner country capacities to design and implement reforms in the area.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
